        +static escapeField(value) string
        +static ensureDataFiles()
    }

    User <|-- Student : inherits
    User <|-- Admin : inherits

    Quiz *-- Question : 1 to 0..*
    Quiz ..> Result : creates
    Result ..> Student : belongs to
    Result ..> Quiz : refers to

    Student ..> Quiz : attempts
    Admin ..> Quiz : manages
    Admin ..> Question : manages
    Admin ..> Result : reports

    User ..> UserRecord : loads
    Result *-- AnswerRecord : per question

    User ..> FileStore : persists through
    Result ..> FileStore : persists through
    Quiz ..> FileStore : persists through
    Question ..> FileStore : persists through

    UI <.. User : rendering
    UI <.. Student : rendering
    UI <.. Admin : rendering
    UI <.. Quiz : rendering
    UI <.. Result : rendering
    UI <.. Question : rendering